  "story": {
    "day": 104,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Morning",
    "sentences": [
      "It was June twenty-second, 8:00 a.m.",
      "Kaya, a fourteen-year-old junior high school student, put on her shorts.",
      "She ran off to the central city for her orchestra meeting.",
      "First, she visited the post office.",
      "Then, she bought one towel and olive oil at a store.",
      "She passed the bank and department store, and a kind police officer waved.",
      "Kaya was a member of the international orchestra.",
      "The director, an elderly man, waited for everybody.",
      "Most other members already sat with their musical instruments.",
      "The hall was noisy, but Kaya did not want to be late.",
      "\"Which piece?\" the fourteenth member asked the sixteenth.",
      "Later, they would look for smiles at the nursing home."
    ]
  }
}